{"ticker":"MRNA","updated":"2026-11-20T23:09:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Moderna, Inc.","shortName":"Moderna, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","website":"https://www.modernatx.com","fullTimeEmployees":4700,"marketCap":78901084160,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-46.553493,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":31.247955,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":164.52632,"targetHighPrice":305.0,"targetLowPrice":45.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.292,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":-0.4202,"operatingMargins":-0.80792,"profitMargins":-1.10455,"totalRevenue":2524999936,"beta":1.166,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":280.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":22.28,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Moderna, Inc., a biotechnology company, provides messenger RNA medicines in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company's respiratory vaccines include spikevax, mNEXSPIKE, mRESVIA, COVID, RSV, seasonal influenza, combination, and pandemic influenza vaccine; latent vaccines comprise cytomegalovirus, epstein-barr virus, and human immunodeficiency virus vaccines; enteric viruses include norovirus; public health vaccines consist of Zika, Nipah, and Mpox vaccines; and bacterial diseases vaccines, such as lyme vaccines. It also provides oncology therapeutics, such as intismeran autogene, cancer antigen therapy, t-cell engager, and cell therapy enhancer; and rare disease products, including propionic and methylmalonic acidemia, and cystic fibrosis. It has strategic alliances and collaborations with Merck & Co., Inc; Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated; Vertex Pharmaceuticals (Europe) Limited; immatics N.V.; Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency; Biomedical Advanced Research and Development Authority; Institute for Life Changing Medicines; The Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation; and OpenAI. The company was formerly known as Moderna Therapeutics, Inc. and changed its name to Moderna, Inc. in August 2018. Moderna, Inc. was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"Moderna, Inc. 是一家生技公司，在美國、歐洲和國際上提供信使 RNA 藥物。該公司的呼吸道疫苗包括spikevax、mNEXSPIKE、mRESVIA、COVID、RSV、季節性流感、聯合疫苗和大流行性流感疫苗；潛伏疫苗包括鉅細胞病毒疫苗、EB病毒疫苗和人類免疫缺陷病毒疫苗；腸道病毒包括諾羅病毒；公共衛生疫苗包括寨卡林疫苗、尼帕姆疫苗和腮腺炎疫苗和細菌性疾病。它還提供腫瘤治療，例如 intismeran 自體基因、癌症抗原治療、T 細胞接合劑和細胞治療增強劑；以及罕見疾病產品，包括丙酸血症和甲基丙二酸血症以及囊性纖維化。與默克公司建立策略聯盟和合作關係；福泰製藥公司；福泰製藥（歐洲）有限公司； immatics N.V.；國防高級研究計劃局；生物醫學高級研究與開發局；改變生活藥物研究所；比爾及梅琳達蓋茲基金會；和 OpenAI。該公司前身為Moderna Therapeutics, Inc.，於2018年8月更名為Moderna, Inc.。 Moderna, Inc.成立於2010年，總部位於麻薩諸塞州劍橋。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"生物技術","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":25.11,"h":27.1,"l":24.88,"c":26.56,"v":16032600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":26.72,"h":26.97,"l":25.66,"c":25.79,"v":8937300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":25.82,"h":26.23,"l":25.522,"c":25.88,"v":7526400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":25.68,"h":25.68,"l":24.44,"c":24.61,"v":10626900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":24.51,"h":24.78,"l":23.91,"c":24.49,"v":10240200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":24.82,"h":25.495,"l":24.44,"c":25.33,"v":8011000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":25.1,"h":26.01,"l":24.56,"c":25.83,"v":9622600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":26.12,"h":28.35,"l":26.12,"c":27.6,"v":17591400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":28.02,"h":28.41,"l":26.99,"c":28.37,"v":10075900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":28.66,"h":28.99,"l":27.915,"c":28.49,"v":8152900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":28.49,"h":28.67,"l":27.48,"c":27.54,"v":8359900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":27.615,"h":27.759,"l":26.91,"c":27.34,"v":6075700},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":27.37,"h":29.45,"l":27.31,"c":27.92,"v":12323600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":28.1,"h":28.3,"l":27.4,"c":27.53,"v":6859100},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":27.78,"h":27.98,"l":26.24,"c":26.83,"v":10103400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":27.24,"h":28.06,"l":26.6,"c":26.74,"v":9187300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":26.32,"h":26.69,"l":26.01,"c":26.25,"v":7042000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":26.59,"h":27.96,"l":26.38,"c":27.72,"v":8529300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":27.845,"h":28.48,"l":27.11,"c":27.14,"v":7